// Example 1: Hello World
// The simplest possible Weave story

=== start ===

Hello, world!

This is your first Weave story. Pretty simple, right?

What would you like to do?

* [Explore more] -> explore
* [End the story] -> END

=== explore ===

Great choice! You're exploring the possibilities of Weave.

Weave is a narrative scripting language designed for:
- Interactive fiction
- Visual novels
- Branching dialogue
- Story-driven games

* [Tell me more] -> more_info
* [I'm done learning] -> END

=== more_info ===

Weave supports:
- Branching choices (like this!)
- Multiple sections and diverts
- Variables and conditionals (coming soon)
- Multimedia integration (coming soon)

The syntax is clean and writer-friendly.

-> END
